    "implementation_delta": "Publish AccelerateBranchAndReleaseGates@1, DatasetsBranchAndReleaseGatesBinding@1, KitBranchAndReleaseGatesBinding@1, and PlatformBranchAndReleaseGates@1. Declared branch-protection policy CID baguqeeram3uegwfx6c4i76eyj5nuzlgsqw6yl5vb5c6drkuyacn5l77ksnna requires protecting default branch main, pull-request reviews, current-head and release status checks, no force-push, no deletion, administrator enforcement, signed commits, and intended signed-tag patterns. Declared release-gate CID baguqeerajahrusqwd33fqbuw46zgqcsw4xsuswdqq6td7c3nyddeeg5qofca requires every named check to pass and prohibits publishing a release after a partial required-build failure. Datasets and Kit bind those CIDs plus PCPR-056 lock CID baguqeerawsekbbbt5ccctjt4tydzeahfkahsatb6q5x7k6cy4inrii5lhqmq and refuse remint without sibling import. Live GitHub branch protection, tag protection, required-status enforcement, and repository-admin application stay typed unavailable. gh and curl are present on the sealed PATH; that is not a live GitHub admin session. No GitHub API call was made and no protection was applied. Missing repository-admin permission emits explicit operator-blocking task pcpr-057-operator-github-governance. The governance gate is not complete. This evaluator never writes DuckDB or Quack state and never emits a closed PCPR release outcome."
  },
